      "description": "A grimy, dilapidated underground space resembling a prison or bunker, with a single hanging light bulb casting a warm, dim light. The floor has some flowers placed on it, and the walls are rough and stained. The scene is framed by the text 'not the shower we deserved but the shower we needed', creating a somber, reflective tone.",
